  "description": {
    "text": "Six cards McDonald's gave with its Pokémon Happy Sets in Japan from 9 to 11 August 2025, 017 to 022 M-P. Each meal came with a sealed pair: a Pikachu drawn for the campaign and one of Sprigatito, Fuecoco, Quaxly, Ralts or Riolu at random. All six print McDonald's logo over the corner of the picture. Customers were asked to buy no more than five meals each, but many restaurants ran out on the first day."
  },
